  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Traben-0/entity_sound_features/master/icon.png\" width=\"150\"><br></p><h1>實體音效功能</h1><hr><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252frURmwrzUcz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/vU8pcbf.png\" alt=\"discord\"></a> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/yZzzW4Q.pngg\" alt=\"-\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/esf-entity-sound-features\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rpoyjVG.png\" alt=\"curseforge\"></a> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/VgKekoJ.png\" alt=\"-\"> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fesf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7fioiRx.png\" alt=\"modrinth\"></a> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/tiNmDIH.png\" alt=\"-\"> <a href=\"https://github.com/Traben-0/entity_sound_features\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EYNx6oL.png\" alt=\"github\"></a> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/yar5K6v.png\" alt=\"-\"> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252ftraben\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/xdhWKwC.png\" alt=\"kofi\"></a></p><hr><h1>關於</h1><p>ESF 是一個模組，可根據 ETF / OptiFine .properties 格式來變化實體的音效。</p><p>ESF 也為 ETF 和 EMF 增加了與音效相關的額外功能，例如音效屬性和音效動畫函數。</p><h1>使用說明</h1><ul>\n<li>關於如何變化現有播放音效的說明與範例，請參閱<a href=\"https://github.com/Traben-0/entity_sound_features/blob/master/VARIATION.MD\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">這份指南</a></li>\n<li>關於如何使用 ETF 和 EMF 新增的音效相關功能，請參閱<a href=\"https://github.com/Traben-0/entity_sound_features/blob/master/UTILITY.MD\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">這份指南</a></li>\n</ul><hr><h1>更新日誌</h1><p>您可以在<a href=\"https://github.com/Traben-0/entity_sound_features/blob/master/CHANGELOG.MD\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a>查看更新日誌。</p><hr><h1>需要幫助或有疑問嗎？</h1><p>您可以透過我的 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252frURmwrzUcz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a>（<em>首選</em>）聯繫，或在 <a href=\"https://github.com/Traben-0/entity_sound_features\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a> 上提出問題。</p><hr><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252frURmwrzUcz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/vU8pcbf.png\" alt=\"discord\"></a> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/yZzzW4Q.pngg\" alt=\"-\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/esf-entity-sound-features\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rpoyjVG.png\" alt=\"curseforge\"></a> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/VgKekoJ.png\" alt=\"-\"> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fesf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7fioiRx.png\" alt=\"modrinth\"></a> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/tiNmDIH.png\" alt=\"-\"> <a href=\"https://github.com/Traben-0/entity_sound_features\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EYNx6oL.png\" alt=\"github\"></a> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/yar5K6v.png\" alt=\"-\"> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252ftraben\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/xdhWKwC.png\" alt=\"kofi\"></a></p><hr><h2>主機合作夥伴方案</h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilling.kinetichosting.com%252faff.php%253faff%253d641\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/BVzZfTc1/images/bfb592538f8206a6a2d72d19c90714bea91b0e07.png\" alt=\"image\"></a></p>",
